          %h2#Definition Definition
          %p
            We will assume that the reader is familiar with basics of the discussion at
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Smooth%E2%88%9EGrpd"} Smooth∞Grpd
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
